From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:15:30 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] battery-low

A banner reads Battery Low: 15% and then Battery Low: 10% once each per
discharge, in a game and on the shelf, above the 5% power-off; plugging
in re-arms them, and nothing shows behind a shut lid or during a
shutdown. From marghost/slot_modded 1706a16, adapted from
suprsomething/slot.advance d495461 (both GPL-3.0), as its own toast
list so Toast::FIXED and upstream's toast tests stay as they are,
https://github.com/marghost/slot_modded/commit/1706a16
https://github.com/suprsomething/slot.advance/commit/d495461
